# Static assets served by Workers Static Assets (vinext/Cloudflare deploy).
# Browser TTL 300s, CDN TTL 3600s, stale-while-revalidate 30s.
# Hashed /_next/static/* keeps long immutable cache (prefer long cache for fingerprints).

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=30
  CDN-Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=30

/_next/static/*
  ! Cache-Control
  ! CDN-Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
